From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reilly Brogan <reilly@reillybrogan.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:27:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] factory: Don't ship nsswitch.conf

glibc now provides the stateless default at /usr/share/defaults/nsswitch.conf,
so stop installing systemd's own copy at /usr/share/factory/etc/nsswitch.conf.
The template stays in the tree as the upstream reference that the recipe's
check phase diffs against.

Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-13
---
 factory/templates/meson.build | 6 ------
 1 file changed, 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/factory/templates/meson.build b/factory/templates/meson.build
index 0f53217..3db9f25 100644
--- a/factory/templates/meson.build
+++ b/factory/templates/meson.build
@@ -15,9 +15,3 @@ custom_target(
         command : [jinja2_cmdline, '@INPUT@', '@OUTPUT@'],
         install : true,
         install_dir : factory_etc_dir)
-
-if conf.get('ENABLE_NSS') == 1
-        install_data(
-                'nsswitch.conf',
-                install_dir : factory_etc_dir)
-endif
